<title>INDIA: India Gujarat Ambuja 1996/97 net seen up.</title>
<headline>India Gujarat Ambuja 1996/97 net seen up.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gujarat Ambuja Cement's net profit is forecast to rise 2.11 percent to 1.51 billion rupees in the year to June 30, 1997, according to a Reuter poll of 28 leading securities and brokerage firms.</p>
<p>The projections ranged from 708 million rupees to 1.88</p>
<p>billion rupees against 1.48 billion in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>GUJARAT AMBUJA ----PAT seen up 2.11%, sales 16.61%</p>
<p>			Net profit  1995/96     Net sales  1995/96</p>
<p>				 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>Average		1,509.46   1,478.20    8,516.36    7,303.50</p>
<p>High		   1,883.00		  10,600.00</p>
<p>Low			780.00		   7,500.00</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
</text>
